e's back."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"We would rather say that here than in small print later. If you are unsure about a commission, ask us before ordering — describing a colour against something you already own is free and takes ten minutes."}]]}],null]}]}],["$","$L2","returns-cancel",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"section-pad-prose wrap-prose text-left ","style":{"backgroundColor":"var(--color-bg)","backgroundImage":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), var(--color-bg))"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-h3 mb-5","children":"Cancelling"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"A ready-to-ship order can be cancelled any time before it is dispatched. A commission can be cancelled until the warp is set; after that the weaver has committed the loom and we have committed the money, and neither can be taken back."}]]}],null]}]}],["$","$L2","returns-damage",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"section-pad-prose wrap-prose text-left ","style":{"backgroundColor":"var(--color-bg)","backgroundImage":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), var(--color-bg))"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-h3 mb-5","children":"If something arrives damaged"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"Photograph it before doing anything else and write to us the same day. Transit damage is our problem rather than yours, and it is settled by replacement, repair or refund depending on what the piece needs."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/pages/contact","className":"cta-link","children":"Write to us"}]}]]}]}]],null]}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/251hl9wif2y5b.js","async":true}],["$","script","script-1",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/0qmvwws_s12e_.js","async":true}]],"$L4"]}],